    {
      "id": "msg_1103_C06R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Planting Berries is good for\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "It provides them with more things\n",
        "to eat in the wild."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1103_C06R0201_00002",
      "en_US": [
